        },
        {
          "text": " omuriiwe tiharyakiramu tabaaza obundi; kandi eiraka rya kishwera n'erya kishwerwa tigarigaruka kuhurirwa omuriiwe, ahakuba abashuubuzi baawe bakaba bari bakuru omu nsi, kandi oburogo bwawe bukagobeza amahanga goona. ",
